 patterns with each chords:","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"    When in Bm play  x x  9 11 10 x      When in G  play  x x 12 12 10 x","columns":72,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"    When in D  play  x x 12 11 10 x      When in A  play  x x 11  9 10 x }","columns":74,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"See the west wind move like a lover so","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Upon the fields of barley","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"Feel her body rise when you kiss her mouth","columns":42,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":29,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":38,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"Among the fields of gold","columns":27,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":1,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D","column":26,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"{ Play this part with the same patterns described above for G, D and A }","columns":72,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"{ Pull the three strings simultaneously 4 times per measure }","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"I never made promises lightly","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":23,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"And there have been some that I've broken","columns":41,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"But I swear in the days still left","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","te